  "segments": [
    {
      "start_ms": 1860,
      "end_ms": 7800,
      "text": "Activity 3 Listen to the conversation and complete the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 7800,
      "end_ms": 8300,
      "text": "table."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 9800,
      "end_ms": 14620,
      "text": "Li Lin, welcome to Students Union Talk today."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 15420,
      "end_ms": 16840,
      "text": "Hello, Wang Peng."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 17640,
      "end_ms": 23160,
      "text": "Today, we are going to talk about a problem for many new students."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 24200,
      "end_ms": 27820,
      "text": "You know, they have more subjects and more homework."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 27820,
      "end_ms": 33440,
      "text": "work. It's hard to plan their time. Do you have any advice for them?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 34240,
      "end_ms": 44960,
      "text": "Sure. Here's my first piece of advice. Every day, write down your tasks and the time for"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 44960,
      "end_ms": 51100,
      "text": "each task. But there are so many tasks. That's my second"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 51100,
      "end_ms": 56240,
      "text": "piece of advice. Do the most important things first."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 57060,
      "end_ms": 61860,
      "text": "But a project may take weeks. How can we plan it?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 62540,
      "end_ms": 73580,
      "text": "Great question! Here's my third piece of advice. Turn a big task into small ones. Then work on"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 73580,
      "end_ms": 74980,
      "text": "them day by day."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 74980,
      "end_ms": 80200,
      "text": "Wow! These ideas are helpful. Thank you, Li Lin."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 88680,
      "end_ms": 95080,
      "text": "Listen again. Then talk about how Wang Peng describes problems."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 97220,
      "end_ms": 101500,
